WEBVTT

00:00:01.500 --> 00:00:04.621
Open Event Subscription

00:00:04.621 --> 00:00:07.140
Click Create Subscription

00:00:07.140 --> 00:00:14.812
Set the method and URL

00:00:14.812 --> 00:00:21.763
Select events; hover the info icon for details

00:00:21.763 --> 00:00:28.898
Add a header (optional)

00:00:28.898 --> 00:00:31.889
Click Create Subscription

00:00:31.889 --> 00:00:33.577
The card shows the URL, events and headers

00:00:33.577 --> 00:00:37.491
Edit a subscription from its menu

00:00:37.491 --> 00:00:42.197
Add an event, then click Update subscription

00:00:42.197 --> 00:00:44.502
Each event takes up to 4 subscriptions
